{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統特朗普在社交媒體發文稱，英偉達董事會作出了讓黃仁勳重回行政總裁一職的正確、恰當的決定。國家需要黃仁勳掌舵英偉達，以保障這家公司取得成功、蓬勃發展，同時助力美國經濟走向繁榮。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587690.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.344089+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:28:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:23.799583+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:23.799583+00:00","content_hash":"bb7d9e292852e8e59b42b0a6907d1e0ca4178e0b9a0ab70bed7a7a5ede8023e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}